{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years ago, my grandmother said she would climb this mountain \u2014 and never returned.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mount Lomyst</i> is a 2D platformer without jumping, where you climb using a grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your missing grandmother\u2019s trail and ascend to the summit of Mount Lomyst.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platformer without jumping!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Memories of your grandmother become clearer as you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and stylized art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 2\u20133 hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear story</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689860?t=1770880228","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3689860?t=1770880228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689860/bd44a7b5bed60edbd2917bd951b377351684fe07/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770880228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689860/bd44a7b5bed60edbd2917bd951b377351684fe07/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770880228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Seven years ago, my grandmother said she would climb this mountain \u2014 and never returned.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mount Lomyst</i> is a 2D platformer without jumping, where you climb using a grappling hook.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow your missing grandmother\u2019s trail and ascend to the summit of Mount Lomyst.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D platf